  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that weighted fusion with resnet50 image encoder (config_010) achieves the highest accuracy so far (0.639). This experiment tests replacing the RNA encoder (pca_n2000 → scgpt) while keeping the image encoder and fusion method consistent, to assess if a more sophisticated RNA representation improves performance. This balances exploitation of the promising weighted fusion/resnet50 combination with exploration of RNA encoder improvements. The expected cost is higher than config_010 (~12-15 GPU hours) but justified by potential accuracy gains."
